{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_10102050","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10102050","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1010205001:0":{"text":"감사합니다. 저를 구해주지 않았다면 저는 아마 저들의 뱃속에 들어가고 말았을 거예요!","source_cn":"谢天谢地，要不是你们救我，我已经进了它们的肚子！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x97D7E26834BD7A12","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1010205002:0":{"text":"제, 제 소개를 드릴게요... 저는 로잔이라고 합니다.","source_cn":"自、自我介绍一下……我叫洛桑。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0937AF0A72237DD9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1010205003:0":{"text":"잠시만요 로잔님... 방금 그들한테 잡아먹힐 뻔했다고 말씀하신 건가요?","source_cn":"等等……洛桑大人，您是说，您差点被它们吃掉？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B92BF7C203D06A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1010205004:0":{"text":"맞아요! 제 가죽을 벗길 칼까지 다 갈아 놓았다니까요!","source_cn":"千真万确！它们连剥皮的刀都磨好了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB09DF71C4D4BBFA3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1010205005:0":{"text":"고블린이 육식을 하긴 하지만, 보통은 자신보다 체형이 작은 초식 동물만 잡아먹는데...","source_cn":"咕布林虽然是肉食性类人生物，但它们的食谱上，只有那些体...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC1CCA84A0FE0A91","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title